# Maps and field scripts

- **`data/maps/<MapName>/map.json`**: Map metadata, connections, music, encounters references. Preserve valid JSON; follow keys and structure of neighboring maps when adding fields.
- **`data/maps/<MapName>/scripts.inc`**: Map-local event scripts (labels, `script` / `event` macros from `asm/macros/event.inc`). Keep flag/var usage consistent with the rest of the map and `include/constants/flags.h` / vars where applicable.
- **`data/scripts/*.inc`**: Shared fragments included from map scripts or events; avoid duplicating logic that already lives in a standard macro or `scrcmd`.

When adding interactions, prefer **existing script commands and macros** before adding new C opcodes. If map tooling (e.g. Porymap) regenerates files in your workflow, edit the source the tool expects and re-export rather than fighting generated layout.
